sequenceDiagram
title Parallel work
participant C as Client
participant A as Alpha
participant B as Beta
autonumber 3
par_over First task
C->>+A: Alpha request
Note right of A: First task note
par Nested fanout
A->>B: Forward
and Nested return
B-->>A: Reply
end
A-->>-C: Alpha done
and Second task
C->>+B: Beta request
critical Guard
Note over C,B: Guard note
option Recover
B-->>C: Recovery
end
B-->>-C: Beta done
and Notes only
Note over A,B: Terminal task note
end
C->>A: After fragment
